Vajna and Mario Kassar, and with several writers working on the screenplay,
filming began in May 2008 in New Mexico, and ran for 77 days.

22
01:30:21,428 --> 01:30:27,428
Terminator Salvation was released on May 21, 2009, by Warner Bros.

23
01:34:27,857 --> 01:34:33,857
Pictures in the United States, and by Sony Pictures Releasing under its Columbia Pictures label
internationally, and grossed over $371.4 million worldwide but received mixed-to-negative reviews.

24
